## Remediation Strategy
To defend against all structural variations listed above, patching individual strings or maintaining a blocklist of keywords like sleep is ineffective. The industry standard defenses include:

   1. Parameterized/Type-Strict Parsing: Ensure the JSON parser rejects anything that isn't a strict integer if the field expects a user ID (e.g., forcing "username" to be strictly numeric or validated against a strict alphanumeric regex). [10] 
   2. Avoid Shell Execution: Never pass raw user inputs into functions like child_process.exec, system(), popen(), or eval(). Use safe alternatives like execFile or spawn where arguments are passed as discrete array elements rather than a combined shell string. [11, 12, 13, 14, 15] 

